le="margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">DEFI DEVELOPMENT CORP.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS-Continued</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">(Unaudited)</span></div></div><ix:continuation id="f-861-1" continuedAt="f-861-2"><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="color:#010928;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Locked SOL</span></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">A portion of our digital assets at fair value includes locked SOL, which we purchase below the spot rate, and cannot be withdrawn from the custodial accounts in which it is held for a predetermined period. Locked SOL may be staked to earn rewards while subject to vesting restrictions.</span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="dfdv:CryptoAssetRestrictedTableTextBlock" id="f-880" escape="true"><div style="margin-bottom:18pt;margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The table below details the future release of our locked SOL, in notional amounts, which also includes collateral related to digital asset financing arrangement term loans of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="token" contextRef="c-129" decimals="-2" name="dfdv:DigitalAssetsCollateralValue" scale="3" id="f-881">290.4</ix:nonFraction> thousand tokens:</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-